# Dependency Management

For detailed dependency management rules, see [docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md](../../docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md#dependency-management).

**Quick reference:**
- **ONLY use `npm`** - alternative package managers (yarn, pnpm, bun) are forbidden
- Always commit `package-lock.json`
- Use `npm ci` in CI/CD environments
- Run `npm audit` regularly for security checks
